; Builds the F*-extracted CASL core (CASL.ml, generated) + two drivers, linked against the
; F* OCaml runtime (fstar.lib):
;   driver.exe  — runs `wellformed` over the bridge corpus (`make -C fstar tcb-bridge`).
;   wf_one.exe  — runs `wellformed` on ONE protocol; the AUTHORITATIVE core judgment for the
;                 CLI (SP-2 / C1). wf_one.ml is regenerated per invocation by src/casl/authoritative.py.
(executables
 (names driver wf_one)
 (modules driver wf_one CASL)
 (libraries fstar.lib)
 (flags (:standard -w -a)))   ; generated code: warnings are not errors
